  "The cell\nMitochondria make energy\nThe nucleus holds the DNA\nRibosomes build proteins\nThe membrane decides what gets in": "Die Zelle\nMitochondrien erzeugen Energie\nDer Zellkern enthält die DNA\nRibosomen bauen Proteine\nDie Membran entscheidet, was reinkommt",
