  "You tell an AI exactly what you want, read what comes back and rewrite your instructions until the answer is useful.": "Du sagst einer KI genau, was du willst, liest, was zurückkommt, und schreibst deine Anweisungen um, bis die Antwort hilft.",
  "An answer that is exactly what you meant": "Eine Antwort, die genau das trifft, was du gemeint hast",
